"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"NK Cell Therapy - Immunotherapy for Solid Tumors\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#F5F7FA]\"><section class=\"relative bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1B4D3E] via-[#2E7D5A] to-[#1B4D3E] text-white py-20\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?w=1920&amp;q=80')] opacity-10 bg-cover bg-center\"></div><div class=\"container-custom relative z-10\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/20 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity \"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg><span>Precision Oncology Treatment</span></div><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight\">Autologous NK Cell Adjuvant Therapy for Solid Tumors</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-white/90 mb-8\">Awaken Innate Immunity, Reshape Solid Tumor Treatment Landscape</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><button class=\"bg-white text-[#1B4D3E] px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white/90 transition-all\">Schedule Consultation</button><button class=\"border-2 border-white text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white/10 transition-all\">Learn About Treatment Process</button></div></div></div></section><div class=\"bg-white shadow-sm sticky top-[72px] z-40\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-6 py-4 text-sm\"><button class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium transition-colors\">Introduction</button><button class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium transition-colors\">Core Advantages</button><button class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium transition-colors\">Indications</button><button class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium transition-colors\">Treatment Process</button><button class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium transition-colors\">Case Studies</button></div></div></div><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-8 text-center\">What is Autologous NK Cell Therapy?</h2><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Natural Killer Cells (NK cells) are core members of the human innate immune system, known as the body's first line of defense against cancer cells and viral infections. Unlike other immune cells, <span class=\"font-semibold text-[#1B4D3E]\">NK cells can directly kill cancer cells without pre-recognition of tumor antigens</span>, and possess broad-spectrum anti-tumor activity.</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">Unlike gene-modified cell therapies such as CAR-T, NK cell therapy technology does not require genetic modification of cells, only requiring in vitro activation and expansion. Its mechanism of action is closer to the body's natural immune response, with higher safety.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"advantages\" class=\"py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Core Advantages - Why Choose Autologous NK Cell Therapy in China?</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Broad-Spectrum Anti-Tumor, Covering Multiple Solid Tumors</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">NK cells can non-specifically recognize and kill various tumor cells without relying on specific antigen expression, suitable for liver cancer, lung cancer, breast cancer, gastric cancer, kidney cancer, colorectal cancer, pancreatic cancer and other solid tumors</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield \"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Excellent Safety Profile</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Autologous cells have no risk of immune rejection; no genetic modification required, no carcinogenic risk; no treatment-related deaths reported in clinical trials, serious adverse reactions are rare</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up \"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Impressive Efficacy Data</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Studies show advanced liver cancer DCR reaches 81.8%, median OS 41.6 months; advanced kidney cancer ORR reaches 76.67%, DCR 86.67%, significantly superior to targeted monotherapy</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-syringe \"><path d=\"m18 2 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m17 7 3-3\"></path><path d=\"M19 9 8.7 19.3c-1 1-2.5 1-3.4 0l-.6-.6c-1-1-1-2.5 0-3.4L15 5\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m5 19-3 3\"></path><path d=\"m14 4 6 6\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">No Lymphocyte Depletion Required</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Compared to CAR-T and other therapies, autologous NK cell therapy generally does not require lymphocyte depletion chemotherapy, reducing additional toxicity burden with better patient tolerance</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Convenient Administration</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Administered via intravenous infusion, can be completed in outpatient or short-term hospitalization without affecting patients' normal life</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap \"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Can Be Combined with Multiple Therapies</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">NK cells can be combined with chemotherapy, targeted therapy, immune checkpoint inhibitors etc. to exert synergistic anti-tumor effects. Studies show combination with PD-1 inhibitors can significantly extend long-term survival in advanced NSCLC patients</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin \"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Leveraging Boao Lecheng Pilot Zone Policy</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Enjoying \"Pilot First\" policy, autologous NK cell therapy technology has been officially approved with transparent pricing, international patients can receive compliant treatment</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Significant Price Advantage</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Only 1/5-1/3 of the cost of similar treatments in Europe and America</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"indications\" class=\"py-20\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Indications - Which Solid Tumor Patients Are Suitable for Autologous NK Cell Therapy?</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Autologous NK cell therapy is mainly suitable for solid tumor patients who still have recurrence risk or treatment failure after standard treatment, as adjuvant or combination therapy</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">Hepatocellular Carcinoma (HCC)</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Studies show disease control rate 81.8%, median OS 41.6 months</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">Advanced Renal Cell Carcinoma</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Clinical trials show ORR 76.67%, DCR 86.67%, significantly superior to targeted monotherapy; simultaneously improves patient immune function and tumor marker levels</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Combined with PD-1 inhibitor (sintilimab) as second-line treatment, can significantly extend survival</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">Advanced Pancreatic Cancer</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">NK cells combined with first-line chemotherapy, DCR reaches 73.7%, median OS 10.8 months, significantly superior to traditional treatment regimens</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"process\" class=\"py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Treatment Process</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Approximately 2-4 weeks from initial diagnosis to recovery</p></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">1</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">Remote Consultation &amp; Initial Screening</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2-5 days</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">Submit medical records, multidisciplinary expert team remotely evaluates treatment indications and feasibility</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">2</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">Visa &amp; Travel Arrangements</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">1-2 weeks</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">Medical visa invitation letters, international insurance coordination, itinerary planning and accommodation arrangements</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">3</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">Arrival in China &amp; Comprehensive Assessment</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2-3 days</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">Comprehensive physical examination, tumor burden assessment, immune function testing, treatment plan determination</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">4</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">Mononuclear Cell Collection</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">1 day</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">Leukapheresis to collect peripheral blood mononuclear cells</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">5</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">NK Cell GMP Preparation</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2-3 weeks</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">NK cell activation, expansion and quality control in GMP laboratory</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">6</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">Intravenous Infusion Treatment</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">30-60 minutes each</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">One course typically includes 3-6 infusions, each interval approximately 2-4 weeks, most treatments can be completed in outpatient setting</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">7</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">Hospital Monitoring</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">3-7 days (first time)</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">Short-term hospital monitoring after first infusion, subsequent treatments can be done outpatient</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">8</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">Long-term Follow-up Management</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Ongoing</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">Regular re-examination, tumor marker monitoring, remote follow-up</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"cases\" class=\"py-20\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Case Studies</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Advanced Liver Cancer Patient</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">A 62-year-old male advanced liver cancer patient whose condition continued to progress after multiple interventional treatments and targeted drug therapy. Received autologous NK cell therapy in 2024, completing 6 infusions. Three-month follow-up showed tumor marker AFP decreased from 856 ng/mL before treatment to 125 ng/mL, imaging assessment showed tumor shrinkage over 50%. Patient's physical condition significantly improved, quality of life markedly enhanced.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Advanced Kidney Cancer Combination Therapy</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">A 55-year-old female advanced renal cell carcinoma patient who had previously received targeted drug therapy but developed resistance. Started NK cell combined with PD-1 inhibitor treatment in 2024, assessment after 4 cycles showed stable disease (SD), with some lesions significantly reduced. Patient had no obvious adverse reactions, good tolerance, continuing maintenance treatment.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Pancreatic Cancer Comprehensive Treatment</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">A 68-year-old male advanced pancreatic cancer patient unable to undergo surgical resection. Received NK cell combined with gemcitabine + albumin-bound paclitaxel chemotherapy regimen, assessment after 3 cycles showed disease control (DCR), tumor marker CA19-9 decreased from 1250 U/mL before treatment to 380 U/mL. Patient's abdominal pain symptoms significantly relieved, appetite improved, weight increased.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6\">Reference Treatment Costs</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-8\">NK cell therapy costs have significant price advantages compared to similar treatments in Europe and America.</p><div class=\"bg-[#1B4D3E] rounded-2xl p-8 text-white\"><p class=\"text-lg mb-4\">Based on treatment plan, total cost is approximately</p><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4\">$30,000 - $60,000</p><p class=\"text-white/70\">Transparent pricing, no hidden fees</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-sm mt-4\">*Specific costs subject to final hospital assessment.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Why Choose Us?</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"p-2 bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] rounded-lg flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-stethoscope \"><path d=\"M4.8 2.3A.3.3 0 1 0 5 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v5a6 6 0 0 0 6 6v0a6 6 0 0 0 6-6V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1a.2.2 0 1 0 .3.3\"></path><path d=\"M8 15v1a6 6 0 0 0 6 6v0a6 6 0 0 0 6-6v-4\"></path><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Direct Access to China's Top Cell Therapy Centers</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Established partnerships with multiple top-tier institutions, providing safe and reliable NK cell therapy services for international patients</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"p-2 bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] rounded-lg flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield \"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Technology Officially Approved for Clinical Application</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Autologous NK cell adjuvant therapy for solid tumors has been included in Hainan Boao Lecheng official fee schedule, c